Title: Big Fish
Author: John August
Draft date: 12/1/2003

INT. WILL'S HOUSE - DAY

Will sits at the kitchen table reading the newspaper.

SANDRA
(softly)
Are you coming to bed?

WILL
In a minute.

They look at each other — a whole conversation in a glance.

CUT TO:

EXT. ALABAMA RIVER - DAY

Edward casts his line into the water.

EDWARD
(v.o.)
There are some fish that cannot be caught.

=
Edward tells his son a tall tale about the river.

# ACT ONE

INT. HOSPITAL ROOM - NIGHT

Will holds his father's hand.

FADE OUT.
